# i18n

See `docs/I18N.md`.

- Default locale: `en`. Always add the same key to `pt.json`.
- Key pattern: `screens.pack.openButton`, `albums.{id}.name`.
- Album manifest uses `nameKey` — never embed PT/EN names only in JSON without keys.
- Atoms: pass translated strings as props. Molecules and up: `useTranslation()`.
- Domain layer: no `i18next` imports.
